Hand edits of the WES 1.1.0 models, applied by utils/build_models.sh.

The generator merges the `anyOf` items of `RunListResponse.runs` and
`RunLog.task_logs` into one struct that has the required fields of both
variants. These edits make the fields optional that only one variant has
(`tags`; `name` and `id`), so that `RunStatus` and `Log` items parse. They
also read the nullable `task_logs` as a plain `Option`, which needs no
`serde_with` dependency, and read `RunLog.request` as `None` if the server
echoes a request that doesn't parse (for example, without its required
fields), so that the run log stays readable; the request is dropped on
purpose.

`State` reads states that the spec doesn't define as `Unknown`, which the
spec defines as the safe default, instead of keeping them in
`Unrecognized`. The enum stays `Copy`. `Unknown` moves to the end, because
`#[serde(other)]` must be on the last variant.

